  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "NM09110",
    "sub_id": "51901",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>評量方式 動作 這門課的最後分數是共由下面幾個項目來綜合評分 1. 期中考占百分之三十 2. 期末考占百分之三十 3. 小考和回家功課共占百分之十五 (回家功課必須在老師規定截止日繳交) 4. 課堂參與和上課點名共占百分之二十五</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Assessment Methods Action The grade of this class is evaluated by the followings\\ points: a. Midterm exam accounts for thirty percent b. Final exam accounts for thirty percent c. Quiz and homework account for fifteen percent (Homework needed to be sumitted by the deadline required by the class instructor) d. Attendance and Class Participation account for twenty five percent</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "課堂規則\n請準時到達課堂 老師授課過程中請保持安靜 勿在堂上大聲交談或使用手機講電話 討論時間可以自由討論\n學期成績期中及期末考各佔30%  請務必參與考試 並用心準備好考試",
    "course_pol_en": "Clearly state your expectations for teacher-student and student-student interactions both in and out of the classroom.\nDemonstrate respect and consideration for the feelings of other students, unexpected noises and movements that automatically divert and attract attention, \n\nTeachers are able to guide students in ways, what students should do in the learning process, and their due responsibilities.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。\n<ul>\n\t<li>考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Design evaluation methods to reduce cheating:\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Using authentic assessment (eg, using real data from assignments that can be used for other/practical purposes), multi-stage assessment (individual written then oral), personal reflection, etc., asking questions that require higher order thinking makes cheating more difficult Disaster.</li>\n\t\t<li>Multivariate assessment and decentralized assessment weights.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>For each type of graded assignment in the course, explain what is and is not allowed to collaborate or receive outside assistance.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
